[
  // Enemy ids are stable forever: biome spawn pools and saved worlds reference
  // enemies by string id. These five are fixed by data/biomes/biomes.json, which
  // already names them in its spawn pools; every enemy_id there must resolve
  // here. Names follow biome-content-spec §3.1 wording — nothing new is invented.
  //
  // loot_table_id must resolve against data/loot_tables/loot_tables.json, or be
  // null, which legitimately means "drops nothing yet".
  //
  // Deliberately absent until Phase 9 (combat and AI): health, damage, defence,
  // movement, spawn conditions, behaviour trees. Guessing a stat block now bakes
  // a wrong shape into authored content.
